{"scene_id": "s00619", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/gen/scenes/s00619.fountain", "heading": "INT. SEASIDE HOTEL - TERRACE RESTAURANT - EVENING", "cast": [{"id": 0, "name": "NAOMI HAYES", "names": ["NAOMI HAYES", "NAOMI"], "gender": "f", "first": 4, "spoke": 11}, {"id": 1, "name": "CALLUM REID", "names": ["CALLUM REID", "CALLUM"], "gender": "m", "first": 5, "spoke": 12}, {"id": 2, "name": "WINIFRED", "names": ["WINIFRED"], "gender": "f", "first": 6, "spoke": 0}, {"id": 3, "name": "JASPER", "names": ["JASPER"], "gender": "?", "first": 6, "spoke": 0}], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "INT. SEASIDE HOTEL - TERRACE RESTAURANT - EVENING", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "White tablecloths flutter in a salt breeze.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "Paper lanterns bob on strings.", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "Beyond the rail, the sea turns violet under a slow, bruised sunset.", "para": 0, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "NAOMI HAYES, 30s, in a pale yellow sundress, stirs a spritz she has not tasted.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "Across from her, CALLUM REID, 30s, a sailor's tan, rolled-up shirtsleeves, turns his wedding band round and round with his thumb.", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "At the next table, WINIFRED, 70s, small as a bird, silver hair swept into a loose bun, and JASPER, 70s, bow tie, cane hooked over the chair, share a plate of oysters and a silence of decades.", "para": 1, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 7, "kind": "action", "text": "She watches them.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 8, "kind": "action", "text": "He watches her watching.", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 9, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "They look happy.", "name": "CALLUM", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 10, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "They look tired.", "name": "NAOMI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 11, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "That's the same thing, at that age.", "name": "CALLUM", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "action", "text": "She laughs, but stops.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "action", "text": "He reaches for her hand across the cloth.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "action", "text": "She lets him hold it, briefly, then eases away to adjust a strap, a napkin, the angle of a fork.", "para": 3, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "action", "text": "Her eyes drift again to Winifred, who lifts an oyster with great care and feeds it, with enormous tenderness, to Jasper, who accepts it without comment, as if this were the plainest thing in the world.", "para": 3, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I should have called.", "name": "CALLUM", "speaker": 1, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You did call.", "name": "NAOMI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Not when it mattered.", "name": "CALLUM", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "No.", "name": "NAOMI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I was a coward.", "name": "CALLUM", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 21, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You were twenty-six.", "name": "NAOMI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 22, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Same difference.", "name": "CALLUM", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 23, "kind": "action", "text": "She smiles, small and sad.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 24, "kind": "action", "text": "A waiter passes, lights the candle at their table, goes.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 25, "kind": "action", "text": "The flame flares and steadies.", "para": 4, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 26, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Callum, why did you come?", "name": "NAOMI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 27, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Because you wrote.", "name": "CALLUM", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 28, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I wrote four lines. About a lighthouse.", "name": "NAOMI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 29, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I read the lighthouse. Over and over.", "name": "CALLUM", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 30, "kind": "action", "text": "She shakes her head, turning the glass slowly by its stem.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 31, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I didn't mean it as an invitation.", "name": "NAOMI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 32, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I know.", "name": "CALLUM", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 33, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I meant it as a goodbye.", "name": "NAOMI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 34, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I know that too.", "name": "CALLUM", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 35, "kind": "action", "text": "Winifred, at the next table, drops her fork.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 36, "kind": "action", "text": "It clatters.", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 37, "kind": "action", "text": "Jasper, without looking, bends to pick it up, handing it back with a courtly little bow.", "para": 6, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 38, "kind": "action", "text": "She nods her thanks.", "para": 6, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 39, "kind": "action", "text": "Their hands linger.", "para": 6, "sent": 4, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 40, "kind": "action", "text": "Naomi sees.", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 41, "kind": "action", "text": "Her face softens, then breaks, and she looks out at the dying sea.", "para": 7, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 42, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I don't want to be tired, Callum.", "name": "NAOMI", "speaker": 0, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 43, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Nobody does.", "name": "CALLUM", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 44, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I want to be like that. Even if it takes sixty years.", "name": "NAOMI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 45, "kind": "action", "text": "He is quiet.", "para": 8, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 46, "kind": "action", "text": "Then he takes off his ring, sets it on the white cloth between them, and slides it toward her until the candlelight catches it.", "para": 8, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 47, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's yours to decide.", "name": "CALLUM", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 48, "kind": "action", "text": "She looks at the ring.", "para": 9, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 49, "kind": "action", "text": "At him.", "para": 9, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 50, "kind": "action", "text": "At the old couple.", "para": 9, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 51, "kind": "action", "text": "At the sea.", "para": 9, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 52, "kind": "action", "text": "And, very gently, she pushes it back.", "para": 9, "sent": 4, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 53, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Keep it. For now.", "name": "NAOMI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}]}